  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DARP SA IndiaRF2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project-level expected impacts are increased access to finance for financially stressed and distressed companies and support financial institutions offloading non-performing loans. Beyond the Project, IFC&apos;s investment is expected to enhance competitiveness and deepen the distressed asset industry in India.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project entails an IFC equity investment of up to US$40 million in India Resurgence Fund 2 (Fund), the second fund raised by India Resurgence Asset Management Business Private Limited (IndiaRF, or the Fund Manager). The Fund will focus on distressed and special situations in India, targeting control turnaround investments and aiming a size of up to US$1 billion.</narrative>
  </description>
